WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:05.088 --> 00:00:09.760
Alex has a physical body break
and a spiritual, emotional break

00:00:09.760 --> 00:00:11.762
where all of these
shackles come down.

00:00:11.803 --> 00:00:13.472
Tell me what’s in the book
Maggie.

00:00:13.597 --> 00:00:14.640
You don’t like me.

00:00:14.640 --> 00:00:15.641
You’ve never liked me.

00:00:15.641 --> 00:00:17.476
That’s not true.

00:00:18.185 --> 00:00:19.353
Which part?

00:00:19.394 --> 00:00:21.438
That I’ve never liked you.

00:00:21.438 --> 00:00:23.607
Marcia Gay is
absolutely incredible.

00:00:23.607 --> 00:00:27.152
These two women laid it all out
and It was this power

00:00:27.152 --> 00:00:29.279
that Maggie Brener 
had over Alex. 

00:00:29.279 --> 00:00:33.659
This little bit of power that
could in fact destroy her career

00:00:33.659 --> 00:00:37.120
Alex is just trying
to survive, desperately.

00:00:37.120 --> 00:00:40.165
It’s a little late to be
storming into my hotel room.

00:00:40.165 --> 00:00:42.042
Now what, what is it you
even want?

00:00:42.042 --> 00:00:44.044
Marcia feels so bad
being so mean to me.

00:00:44.127 --> 00:00:46.296
We both end a scene where we’re
not nice to each other

00:00:46.296 --> 00:00:47.673
we said, I’m so sorry.

00:00:47.673 --> 00:00:50.676
My interest is in trying to do
right by your daughter.

00:00:51.426 --> 00:00:52.928
They’re going to try and make it
seem like she had problems

00:00:52.928 --> 00:00:54.554
long before she got to UBA.

00:00:54.554 --> 00:00:56.056
What kind of problems?

00:00:56.682 --> 00:01:00.477
Cory’s wrestling with
protecting Hannah, protecting

00:01:00.477 --> 00:01:04.523
the name of a victim who can’t
speak for herself

00:01:04.523 --> 00:01:08.110
and with the specter of Fred
hanging over him saying,

00:01:08.110 --> 00:01:09.778
"I’m gonna out you
 at any point."

00:01:09.778 --> 00:01:13.573
--- which if it was uncovered, it
would be a problem for his

00:01:13.573 --> 00:01:14.700
relationship with Bradley

00:01:14.700 --> 00:01:18.662
That fact that Cory is able to
navigate that in some way is,

00:01:18.662 --> 00:01:20.163
I think, quite interesting.

00:01:20.163 --> 00:01:23.125
Billy is so good this season.

00:01:23.125 --> 00:01:25.335
He’s in this position of power,

00:01:25.335 --> 00:01:27.212
he has all these
feelings about Bradley.

00:01:27.212 --> 00:01:30.132
They’re so complicated,
there’s so much at stake.

00:01:30.132 --> 00:01:33.510
Billy is one of the most
fascinating minds alive,

00:01:33.510 --> 00:01:37.806
and brings things to this
character that just,

00:01:37.806 --> 00:01:40.183
I mean you watch every take
and you’re just

00:01:40.183 --> 00:01:43.478
in awe of what comes out of him.

00:01:43.478 --> 00:01:45.480
I don’t blink when he is acting.

00:01:45.689 --> 00:01:47.691
I didn’t want to be this person.

00:01:50.360 --> 00:01:52.362
I didn’t want to hurt anyone.

00:01:53.238 --> 00:01:54.906
I didn’t want people to think

00:01:54.906 --> 00:01:57.701
I was the kind of person that
could hurt someone.

00:01:57.701 --> 00:01:59.661
In that scene Steve Carell

00:01:59.661 --> 00:02:01.621
just moved everybody on set

00:02:01.621 --> 00:02:03.915
and I think it’s really a
testament to how

00:02:03.915 --> 00:02:05.876
incredible an actor he is.

00:02:06.376 --> 00:02:08.712
There’s a wonderful dynamic
between Mitch and Paola

00:02:08.712 --> 00:02:11.131
because she was not a part of
his previous world.

00:02:11.214 --> 00:02:15.469
He feels like he can probably
speak in a more unfettered

00:02:15.510 --> 00:02:16.970
pure way with her.

00:02:16.970 --> 00:02:20.515
So she’s a wonderful vessel for
us to see what exactly is

00:02:20.515 --> 00:02:22.476
Mitch purely thinking.

00:02:22.476 --> 00:02:25.520
Mitch realizes that he did
terrible things and

00:02:25.520 --> 00:02:28.440
that there were real
consequences for his actions

00:02:28.440 --> 00:02:30.150
and that he really hurt people.

00:02:30.150 --> 00:02:32.986
Paola asks him the questions
that he’s asking himself

00:02:32.986 --> 00:02:35.697
on the inside and she’s forcing
him to confront these issues

00:02:35.697 --> 00:02:37.074
and answer those questions.

00:02:37.407 --> 00:02:39.368
I’m just pretty damaged.

00:02:40.202 --> 00:02:41.536
I know.

